### Changes Made (11 total)

**Transition fixes (3):**
- **§3 → §4** *(was Weak — cartoon father to a 2006 tour date, no signal)*: added "The loudest thing that boy ever did runs against all of it." Carries "boy" forward, sets up "backwards."
- **§5 → §6** *(was Broken — Riyadh ethics to helicopters)*: added "Philadelphia and Riyadh are the reflex with a target in the room. It also runs on nothing." This was the worst boundary in the piece: §6 is the only body section §1 doesn't forward-announce, and its organizing contrast ("a threat you can point at… the ambient kind is the one that gets you") only arrived in the section's *last* paragraph — so helicopter/money/MRI/Rousey read as four unrelated topics. The contrast now opens the section.
- **§7 → §8** *(was Weak)*: added "The public version of that job does not read as protection," carrying "that job" from the "dies with me" pull quote into SNL.

**Internal flow / logic fixes (4):**
