- §6: "He said so himself, unprompted" contradicted "Ferriss asked how he got into helicopters" two sentences up. Now "He volunteered that in one breath."
- §1: "The corpus says something more useful than 'rare'" answered a claim the reader never saw. Replaced with the objection the stats actually rebut: comedians are supposed to be Sevens.
- §1: cut the mechanical signpost "Now the pressure test, because…"

